  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
    <defName>Gray_Apparel_Sweater</defName>
    <description>A plain sweater, common on planets without artificial climate control, and thoroughly imbued with a housewife vibe.\nThough the Gray do not fear the cold, this human-style clothing helps them blend in with humans during certain seasons.\nSome white-haired enthusiasts are especially eager to visit Gray settlements in winter to photograph them wearing this.</description>
