  <!--婚纱-->
  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
    <defName>Gray_Apparel_WeddingDress</defName>
    <description>A magnificent wedding dress embodying longing and happiness—but for the Gray, it means far more.\nIn an Empire of immense material abundance, Gray with legal citizenship can buy one at any time or make one by hand, but the most important meaning of a wedding dress has always been bestowed by one's other half.\nFor the Gray, walking down the aisle with a lover 'to hold hands and grow old together' not only symbolizes the beginning of a beautiful marriage, but also represents the complete recognition of their intelligence—as if 'being treated as a human being.' Who is to say this is not the ultimate fantasy of every Gray?\nA distant wind-song carries a message, reminding you of one thing:\nAmong the brilliant stars of the night sky, a star draped in a veil of light still waits for their return.</description>
